integer</td><td data-label=3D"Required" data-astro-cid-fjq3275k=3D"">No</td=
><td data-label=3D"Description" data-astro-cid-fjq3275k=3D"">Optional cost =
ceiling. IDR integer. Reactivation is refused with 422 VALIDATION_ERROR if =
the live cost exceeds it.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=3D"note" =
data-astro-cid-fjq3275k=3D"">Like create, this is a money mutation =E2=80=
=94 pass an Idempotency-Key header for safe retries (a create and a reactiv=
ate can never collide on one key). Reusing a key with a different body retu=
rns 422 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED, and a still-settling request with that key =
returns 409 REQUEST_IN_PROGRESS. A number that cannot be reactivated return=
s 409 CONFLICT; too-low balance returns 409 INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE.</p><h4 da=
